{"data":{"body":"[P2] An ordinary failure from `MDC.getCopyOfContextMap()` is passed to `finishFailure`, which produces a terminal `FAILED` durable execution before user code starts. A transient logging-adapter problem can therefore permanently fail the customer workflow. Treat this as a retryable invocation failure, or capture MDC best-effort with a safe fallback, and update the test that currently expects `FAILED`.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77497z","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":299,"observation_digest":"57d29062e686c42d93ee5a367ef6b48cd2cb17133b5be205ab5d0d7313860a34","observation_id":"aro_v1_k7jjayxgq3cc3e7oli3h55vurt","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-09T02:20:22Z","review_id":"arr_v1_hyhhujz5d345gd5gjgv3rog337","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"c59039a8be52bf63f76d100110e28cd66d4ec510","reviewer":"codex","start_line":298,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_zjwa4aa3cwtfbl27xqy5w3qm6t","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T02:20:22Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
